Add Oh My Pi's native lifecycle extension and recognize omp as a parent agent, so a Claude worker cannot reset its pane. Both forms. OMP uses agent_end.willContinue, not Pi's agent_settled event. Applied after 0010-origin-pane-boundary.patch.

